    "body": "<!-- issue-sweep: DONE -->\nIssue sweep: already done on main.\n- A test pins that a band that only touches the shank top does not widen the judged shank: PR #2207, merge 8ea68257ffa6eb9c980ac853bc5f9f9b10cca200. Pinned by `a_band_touching_only_the_shank_top_does_not_widen_the_judged_shank` and `issue_2180_cone_touching_only_shank_top_never_widens_shank`.\n- No collision law reads a smaller body than the real one: PR #2207, merge 8ea68257ffa6eb9c980ac853bc5f9f9b10cca200. Pinned by `holder_narrower_than_stated_shank_never_shrinks_shank_judgement` and `shank_with_body_never_shrinks_stated_shank_or_neck`.",
